    1 | G4 A4 G4   | Si-lent night,
    2 | E4         |
    3 | G4 A4 G4   | ho-ly night,
    4 | E4         |
    5 | D5 D5      | All is calm,
    6 | B4         |
    7 | C5 C5      | all is bright,
    8 | G4         |
    9 | A4 A4      | Round yon
   10 | C5 B4 A4   | Vir-gin
   11 | G4 A4 G4   | Mo-ther and
   12 | E4         | Child.
   13 | A4 A4      | Ho-ly
   14 | C5 B4 A4   | In-fant so
   15 | G4 A4 G4   | ten-der and
   16 | E4         | mild,
   17 | D5 D5      | sleep in
   18 | F5 D5 B4   | hea-ven-ly
   19 | C5         | peace,
   20 | E5         |
   21 | C5 G4 E4   | sleep in hea-
   22 | G4 F4 D4   | -ven-ly
   23 | C4         | peace.
   24 | (C4)       |
-->
